@* HelpInboxPage: help topic "Your inbox" at "/help/inbox". Static text. *@
@page "/help/inbox"

<HelpTopicFrame Slug="inbox">
    <section class="card">
        <p>The <a href="/inbox" data-testid="help-inbox-link">Inbox</a> lists the reviews that are waiting for you.
            The home page shows how many need your action. Open a row to go to the review.</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>To sign</strong>: you are the primary or alternate reviewer of a slot that has no current
                signature, or whose signature is out of date because the review changed after you signed.</li>
            <li><strong>Replies waiting</strong>: the last comment of an open thread is             from someone else, and you hold a slot of the review and wrote in that thread, or you created the review.</li>
            <li><strong>Failed checks</strong>: you created the review and a check of a section that applies is
                answered Fail.</li>
            <li><strong>Updates</strong>: a review of yours was approved or reopened by someone else since you last
                looked. Updates are for information and are not counted as work.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>A <strong>New</strong> marker shows what happened since you last saw the review. On the review page,
            comments by others that you have not seen carry the same marker until your next visit.
            <strong>Mark all as read</strong> clears the markers of every listed review. An approved review needs no
            action, so it leaves the three action groups. You only see reviews of projects you are a member of, and a
            read-only role does not get the groups that ask for a signature or a reply.</p>
    </section>
</HelpTopicFrame>
